# Optional. The demo already has live subway times without this key (Transitous).
# Add a key only if you want Google's own Directions times (the ~33 min subway
# trip you see on maps.google.com). Enable the Directions API, then start the
# backend with `npm run dev` (it loads this file when present).
# Server-side only. The React app never receives this value.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Set to 0 to skip Google and Valhalla and serve the labeled Columbia → Soothr fixture.
# MAPS_LIVE=0
